<p><strong>Validasyonlar:</strong></p>
<p>PaymentPoolService servisinde createPaymentPool methodunda yap=C4=B1lan =
validasyonlar =C5=9Funlard=C4=B1r:</p>
<p>createPaymentPool ba=C5=9F=C4=B1nda requestDate bo=C5=9Fsa bug=C3=BCn=C3=
=BCn tarihi atan=C4=B1r.</p>
<p><strong>validateApiRequest i=C3=A7inde:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"94e3eff8-dd51-4ac4-b8c1-2831b74a2984">receivingIban veya =
(receivingBankCode + receivingSubsidiaryCode + receivingAccountNo) zorunlud=
ur.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cbf37880-e004-442c-9d20-5ea4cbaa2952">swiftCode TL de=C4=
=9Filse receivingSwiftCode zorunludur.</li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
 <strong>checkDuplicatePaymentPool i=C3=A7inde:</strong>
</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"54022a73-803b-45ff-9cfe-9576521639d0">paymentIdentifier d=
oluysa, ayn=C4=B1 sourceCode + paymentIdentifier i=C3=A7in blocking stat=C3=
=BClerde kay=C4=B1t varsa hata verilir.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>validateSave i=C3=A7inde:</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"11771b91-f64b-40a9-a4ca-2b667cadd436">=C3=96deme tarihi g=
e=C3=A7mi=C5=9Fte olamaz.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c1df12ab-c649-4085-8e98-53a579cece66">=C3=96deme tarihi b=
ug=C3=BCnse cutoff kontrol=C3=BC yap=C4=B1l=C4=B1r, gerekirse ileri i=C5=9F=
 g=C3=BCn=C3=BCne al=C4=B1n=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"421a9fce-f607-4c8c-bc3f-b7eb15afb432">=C3=96deme tarihi b=
ug=C3=BCn de=C4=9Filse i=C5=9F g=C3=BCn=C3=BC normalize edilir.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2e99d5f4-afd3-4cbf-8f5a-0617826561b8">=C3=96deme kodu (pa=
ymentCode) s=C4=B1f=C4=B1rdan b=C3=BCy=C3=BCk olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c0251620-a03c-46a3-9877-6268e1363a23">Bran=C5=9F kodu (br=
anchCode) s=C4=B1f=C4=B1rdan b=C3=BCy=C3=BCk olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"78f26cfd-ceb7-4a8b-acc1-069738ec6cd1">D=C3=B6viz kodu (sw=
iftCode) bo=C5=9F olamaz.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fe9a461f-75d5-43aa-b90e-db80d15d3f78">D=C3=B6viz kodu ge=
=C3=A7erli d=C3=B6viz kodlar=C4=B1 listesinde olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ad756938-a167-4def-8324-51731cc0c088">D=C3=B6viz kodu eng=
elli swift listesinde olmamal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b35c6024-6d16-46d6-84e9-1831075b9fc7">PAYMENT_AMOUNT vali=
dasyonu aktifse =C3=B6deme tutar=C4=B1 bo=C5=9F olamaz ve 0=E2=80=99dan b=
=C3=BCy=C3=BCk olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0dd70bbb-3b72-4cf5-a19f-8fb908797b48">Al=C4=B1c=C4=B1 ver=
gi/kimlik no bo=C5=9F olamaz ve en az 10 karakter olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"24e8ac66-88b2-45b2-adaa-0ff78e37f591">RECEIVING_NAME_SURN=
AME validasyonu aktifse al=C4=B1c=C4=B1 ad/unvan bo=C5=9F olamaz.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"33c4496b-a43d-445c-a3db-29fb0e7e588f">Al=C4=B1c=C4=B1 IBA=
N ve hesap no ayn=C4=B1 anda bo=C5=9F olamaz.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9c7ef281-9f99-4b2a-b7e0-4807bd51f651">=C4=B0=C5=9Flemi ya=
pan kullan=C4=B1c=C4=B1 kodu (creatingUserid) bo=C5=9F olamaz.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d12ac6d9-5030-47a4-9235-900a8e6a44eb">SENDING_BANK_CODE v=
alidasyonu aktifse g=C3=B6nderici IBAN bo=C5=9F olamaz.</li>
