 doluysa ge=C3=A7erli IBAN format=C4=B1nda olmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>validateSave sonras=C4=B1, createPaymentPool ak=C4=B1=C5=9F=C4=
=B1ndaki ek kontrol/i=C5=9F kurallar=C4=B1:</strong></p>
<ul>
